---
import {scenarios,scenarioCandidates} from '../data/selection';
import {topics} from '../data/site';
import BrandCard from './BrandCard.astro';
const {kind}=Astro.props as {kind:string};const scenario=scenarios[kind],matches=scenarioCandidates(kind),visible=matches.slice(0,6);
---
<div class="page-body scenario-page"><section class="dossier-lead"><span class="tag">按场景选择</span><h2>{scenario.heading}</h2><p class="dossier-deck">{scenario.context}</p></section><div class="scenario-columns"><section class="checklist-panel"><h2>四个实际检查步骤</h2><ol>{scenario.steps.map((step,i)=><li><span>0{i+1}</span><p>{step}</p></li>)}</ol></section><aside class="editor-note caution"><strong>这个场景最容易踩的坑</strong><p>{scenario.pitfall}</p><a class="button secondary" href={kind==='stable'?'/ranking/stable/':kind==='streaming'?'/blog/streaming-checklist/':kind==='ai'?'/blog/ai-access/':'/blog/choose-a-service/'}>阅读详细核对方法 →</a></aside></div>{kind==='streaming'&&<p class="muted">平台原始说明：<a href="https://help.netflix.com/en/node/87" rel="noopener noreferrer">Netflix 数据用量</a> · <a href="https://help.netflix.com/en/node/114701" rel="noopener noreferrer">VPN 使用限制</a>。以上是平台说明与计算示例，不是品牌播放实测。</p>}<section class="criteria-box"><span class="eyebrow">HOW THIS SHORTLIST IS BUILT</span><h2>候选如何筛选</h2><p>{scenario.rule}</p><strong>符合参考条件 {matches.length} 家 · 此处展示前 {visible.length} 家</strong><p>仅使用已收录的月付参考档；未知报价与 GiB 口径不混入 GB 筛选。不是全市场名单，也不保证当前在售。</p></section><div class="grid three">{visible.map(({airport,plan})=><BrandCard airport={airport} plan={plan}/>)}</div><div class="dossier-next"><a class="button" href="/compare/">选择 2–4 家进一步比较 →</a><a class="button secondary" href="/airport/">查看完整品牌目录</a></div><section class="scenario-followup"><h2>付款前，最后核对一次</h2><div class="purchase-checklist">{['当前套餐的价格、币种、付款周期与续费总额','实际月额度、重置日、倍率与用完后的处理','自己的设备、客户端及订阅方式是否受支持','支持渠道、退款限制与目标平台的使用规则'].map(text=><label><input type="checkbox"/><span>{text}</span></label>)}</div><p class="muted">复选框仅帮助你整理检查进度，不代表本站已经完成验证。</p></section><div class="section-head"><h2>继续看其他场景</h2><a href="/recommend/">返回推荐中心 →</a></div><div class="topic-links">{topics.filter(t=>t.slug!==kind).map(t=><a class="button secondary" href={`/recommend/${t.slug}/`}>{scenarios[t.slug].title} →</a>)}</div></div>
